## ObjectType: 库存预占

订单行实际预占及缺货待补记录；仅active状态的实际预占扣减可售量，待补数量不再扣减。

### Data Source

| Type | ID | Name |
|------|----|------|
| resource | ecommerce_resource_inventory_reservation | inventory_reservations |

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|------|--------------|------|-------------|--------------|
| reservation_id | 库存预占ID | integer | 库存预占ID | reservation_id |
| order_id | 订单ID | integer | 订单ID | order_id |
| item_id | 明细ID | integer | 明细ID | item_id |
| sku_id | SKU ID | integer | SKU ID | sku_id |
| warehouse_id | 仓库ID | integer | 仓库ID | warehouse_id |
| ordered_quantity | 订单行购买数量 | integer | 订单行购买数量 | ordered_quantity |
| reserved_quantity | 实际预占数量 | integer | 实际预占数量 | reserved_quantity |
| backorder_quantity | 缺货待补数量 | integer | 缺货待补数量 | backorder_quantity |
| expected_date | 预计补货日期 | date | 预计补货日期 | expected_date |
| po_item_id | 采购明细ID | integer | 采购明细ID | po_item_id |
| status | 业务状态 | string | 业务状态 | status |

### Property Constraints

```yaml
ordered_quantity:
  value_type: positive_goods_quantity
reserved_quantity:
  value_type: nonnegative_goods_quantity
backorder_quantity:
  value_type: nonnegative_goods_quantity
```

